# Ruijie RGOS show version Module information parser.
#
# Sample input (templates/samples/ruijie_10_62_63_21_show_version.txt):
#   System serial number    : G1HLC0R000096
#   Module information:
#     Slot M1 : M8600E-CM
#       Hardware version    : 1.03
#       Boot version        : 1.2.25
#       Software version    : S8600E_RGOS 11.0(4)B8P3
#       Serial number       : G1HLC0R000096
#     Slot 1 : M8600E-24GT20SFP4XS-ED
#       ...
#       Serial number       : G1P7286000129
#
# Field semantics:
#   SLOT       — slot identifier (M1, M2, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5).
#   MODULETYPE — vendor module model string (M8600E-CM, ...).
#   SN         — vendor-issued serial number for the module.
#
# Strategy: Start captures the top-level System serial number (chassis).
# When the parser hits the 'Module information:' marker it transitions
# to the Modules state. Modules state matches each 'Slot <SLOT> : <TYPE>'
# line and captures the slot's serial number on the following
# 'Serial number' line, recording once per slot.

Value CHASSIS_SN (\S+)
Value SLOT (\S+)
Value MODULETYPE (\S+)
Value SN (\S+)

Start
  ^System\s+serial\s+number\s*:\s*${CHASSIS_SN}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Module\s+information:\s*$$ -> Modules

Modules
  ^\s*Slot\s+${SLOT}\s+:\s+${MODULETYPE}\s*$$
  ^\s*Serial\s+number\s*:\s*${SN}\s*$$ -> Record
